data: {"id": "da36e1ed61024b72-thinking-parallel_evidence-2227", "run_id": "da36e1ed61024b72", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Let me analyze the evidence collected for `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` in namespace `aiops-case-09`.\n\n**实体身份和当前状态确认:**\n- Pod: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`, namespace: `aiops-case-09`\n- 节点: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- 镜像: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, 命令: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- 容器状态: Running (已启动 Mon, 07 Sep 2026 18:55:19 +0000)\n- 关键条件: `Ready: status=False, reason=ContainersNotReady, message=containers with unready status: [app]`\n- Readiness Probe: **持续失败，HTTP 503** (War", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788813443948, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

